<section data-sec id="g-foundry" style="background: #0B0C0D; color: #EDEEEE; padding: 140px 0">
<div style="max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 56px">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 40px; flex-wrap: wrap">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<div style="font-family: GeistMono, monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; color: #8C9194">05 · OUROS FOUNDRY</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(44px, 5.2vw, 80px); line-height: .96; letter-spacing: -0.04em">A materials lab built<br>like a production line.</h2>
</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; color: #A9AEB0; max-width: 440px">Customers bring a problem and fund development. We engineer the material, prove it, and hand off a qualified process to partner-funded production.</p>
</div>
<div style="position: relative; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border: 1px solid #23272A"><video preload="none" data-src="/media/mg-line-dark.mp4" poster="/media/mg-line-dark-poster.webp" autoplay="" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; "></video></div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap"><div style="flex: 1 1 280px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #33373A; padding-top: 18px">
<div style="height: 220px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: #1A1B1C"><video preload="none" data-src="/media/benchlab.mp4" poster="/media/benchlab-poster.webp" autoplay="" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; "></video></div><div style="font-family: GeistMono, monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; font-size: 11px; color: #8C9194">01</div><div style="font-size: 22px">Automated R&amp;D</div><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #A9AEB0">A miniature production line of modular stations dispenses, presses, cures and scans samples around the clock, engineering composites to a customer’s spec.</p></div><div style="flex: 1 1 280px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #33373A; padding-top: 18px">
<div style="height: 220px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: #1A1B1C"><video preload="none" data-src="/media/compress.mp4" poster="/media/compress-poster.webp" autoplay="" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; "></video></div><div style="font-family: GeistMono, monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; font-size: 11px; color: #8C9194">02</div><div style="font-size: 22px">Testing &amp; qualification</div><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #A9AEB0">Fire, strength and durability testing in-house, so results come back in minutes instead of the three months outside labs take.</p></div><div style="flex: 1 1 280px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #33373A; padding-top: 18px">
<div style="height: 220px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: #1A1B1C"><video preload="none" data-src="/media/robopress.mp4" poster="/media/robopress-poster.webp" autoplay="" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; "></video></div><div style="font-family: GeistMono, monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; font-size: 11px; color: #8C9194">03</div><div style="font-size: 22px">Pilot manufacturing</div><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #A9AEB0">Production-size parts on sensor-instrumented lines, with a process that transfers directly into partner-funded factories.</p></div></div>
<div style="border: 1px dashed #3A3F42; padding: 18px 22px; display: flex; gap: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center">
<div style="font-family: GeistMono, monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; font-size: 11px">DATA LAYER</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: #A9AEB0">Every formulation, process setting and test result in one dataset. Each program makes the next material faster to develop.</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

